OL,3,GNEWSATwo children among four dead in
OL,4,AWaterford house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo children are among four people who
OL,7,Fhave died following a house fire in
OL,8,FWaterford city in the Republic of
OL,9,FIreland.
OL,11,FTwo other children are critically
OL,12,Finjured following the blaze at the
OL,13,Fproperty on house on Birchwood Avenue.
OL,15,FThe fire was reported to Waterford Fire
OL,16,FService at 05:13 local time on Tuesday
OL,17,Fand its crews arrived to a
OL,18,F"well-developed fire".
OL,20,FIt said "a number of casualties were
OL,21,Fremoved from the two-storey house"
OL,22,Fbefore the blaze was extinguished.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
